<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys shares at $6.64/6 during day.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys shares at $6.64/6 during day.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said it had bought back 258,200 shares on market at prices between NZ$6.64 to $6.66 as p art of its latest share buyback programme during Monday.</p>
<p>This represented 0.01410 percent of the total number of issued shares in Telecom at the beginning of the day.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said the total number of issued shares in Telecom following the latest purchase was 1,831,033,791.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
